# This folder will contain downloaded PyTorch models and converted CoreML models
# Models are not committed to git due to their large size

## Expected files after running download_model.py:
# - RCAN_BIX2.pt
# - RCAN_BIX3.pt
# - RCAN_BIX4.pt
# - RCAN_BIX8.pt
# - RCAN_BDX3.pt

## Expected files after running convert_to_coreml.py:
# - RCAN_BIX3.mlpackage/ (directory)
# - RCAN_BIX3_quantized.mlpackage/ (directory, if --quantize flag used)
#
# Note: .mlpackage is a directory bundle (ML Program format for iOS 15+)
